--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,14 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Commands
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of each command. Some commands:
+
+* `init`: creates a new analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports`: generates the reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report (`<analysisRoot>/_sokrates_landscape/index.html`), aggregating the results of multiple analyses. This is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands. `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name and still works.
+
 ### Docker
 
 Build the docker image:
